  "title": "PTPV2: Malformed Packet error when parsing IEEE_C37_238 TLV",
  "description": "The organizationSubtype field with the IEEE_C37_238 2017 TLV is\nincorrectly being parsed twice. This is causing subsequent packets\ncontents to be parsed erroneously and causing Malformed error or\nexception being thrown.\nThis problem was not there in versions v4.4.0 and earlier of Wireshark.\nThe changes removes the double parsing.\n\nAs a comparision, on the left side is version 4.7.0 with the problem and on the right is 4.4.0 where things were fine.\n![wireshark_bug](/uploads/eceac232ad729b228f32a039461d994c/wireshark_bug.png)\n\nAfter applying the fix:\n![wireshark_with_the_fix](/uploads/edfda4193820ab65daed8c115fb21a30/wireshark_with_the_fix.png)",
